# Source-of-Truth Files for the Chrome Extension

The extension is loaded from the `pages/connect/` directory. **All UI fixes must go here.**

## Canonical files

| Purpose | Edit this file | NOT this one |
|---|---|---|
| Dashboard HTML | `pages/connect/index.html` | ~~`index.html`~~ / ~~`pages/dashboard/index.html`~~ |
| Dashboard CSS | `pages/connect/index.css` | ~~`index.css`~~ / ~~`pages/dashboard/dashboard.css`~~ |
| Dashboard logic | `pages/connect/dashboard-logic.js` | ~~`dashboard-logic.js`~~ / ~~`pages/dashboard/dashboard.js`~~ |

## How to confirm you're in the right file

When in doubt, run this in the browser console on the extension page:

```js
[...document.styleSheets].map(s => s.href)
```

The result will contain `chrome-extension://.../pages/connect/index.css` — confirming `pages/connect/` is what's live.

## Rule

Before editing any dashboard HTML/CSS/JS, check that the file path starts with `pages/connect/`. If you find yourself editing root-level or `pages/dashboard/` files for a dashboard UI change, stop and redirect to `pages/connect/`.
